ge-accounting; https://openrouter.ai/docs/guides/routing/provider-selection; https://openrouter.ai/docs/api_reference/streaming. Sources (WebFetch 2026-10-08): platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/models/list; developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/models/methods/list (base https://api.openai.com/v1, Bearer); api-docs.deepseek.com/api/list-models (GET /models, base https://api.deepseek.com); docs.z.ai/api-reference/introduction (global https://api.z.ai/api/paas/v4, no models list documented); docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/api/introduction (China https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4); openrouter.ai/docs/api/api-reference/api-keys/get-current-api-key; docs.vllm.ai (--api-key guards /v1/*).",
